                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Should I buy SAP IBP or a mid-market SCM?</h3>
                                        <p>SAP IBP for enterprises with global ops and existing SAP footprint. Mid-market SCM (o9, e2open) for growth-stage. India-first tools (Increff, Unicommerce) for D2C / retail mid-market.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the ROI of demand forecasting software?</h3>
                                        <p>10-25% inventory reduction + 15-30% stockout reduction. For a ₹200 Cr revenue company, that translates to ₹8-25 Cr working capital release + revenue protection.</p>
                                        <h3>Is custom SCM ever the right answer?</h3>
                                        <p>Rarely — but for pharma cold chain, jewelry logistics, or specialty categories with unique flows, yes. Otherwise configure a mid-market tool.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I handle India → UAE cross-border ops?</h3>
                                        <p>Multi-warehouse allocation logic + duty / VAT calculation + coordinated cross-border logistics. Custom or heavily-configured. Off-shelf tools rarely handle the nuance.</p>
